      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Species traits",
          "lines": [
            "Medium Outsider from the Plane of Shadow. The species entry gives the Extraplanar subtype away from that plane. Humanoid-only effects such as charm person cannot target a Shadowswyft.",
            "+2 Dexterity, −2 Constitution. Land speed 40 ft. Darkvision 120 ft. and low-light vision.",
            "Light Blindness is extraordinary. Abrupt exposure to bright light, such as sunlight or a daylight spell, blinds the Shadowswyft for 1 round. Afterward, it remains dazzled while in the affected area.",
            "Dazzled imposes −1 on attack rolls, Search checks, and Spot checks. Use the normal Blinded condition for the first round.",
            "+2 bonus on initiative checks. +4 racial bonuses on Hide and Move Silently.",
            "Automatic languages are Shadowswyft and Common. Bonus languages are Abyssal, Celestial, and Elven. Favored class Rogue. LA +1. The player profile adds no racial Hit Dice."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Original NPC · Mheer Wink",
          "lines": [
            "Covered stair runner and Rogue.",
            "Motive. Get the spare key to the watch before the covered passage closes.",
            "Hook. Mheer can check the dark landing while the party works the shutter from below.",
            "Shadowswyft covered stair runner, Rogue 1 · Provisional CR 2. ECL 2 (1 class HD, LA +1). · Medium Outsider (Extraplanar)",
            "AC 16 · HP 7 (1d6+1) · Speed 40 ft."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Original NPC · Pohl Nod",
          "lines": [
            "Gloam road lookout and Ranger.",
            "Motive. Get the late travellers off the road before undead reach the arches.",
            "Hook. Pohl can watch the approaches while the party moves the travellers from arch to arch.",
            "Shadowswyft gloam road lookout, Ranger 1 · Provisional CR 2. ECL 2 (1 class HD, LA +1). · Medium Outsider (Extraplanar)",
            "AC 16 · HP 9 (1d8+1) · Speed 40 ft."
          ]
        }
      ],
